No spoilers, just a few observations about what's new in 3.1

(I've only been playing for a few minutes -- this is just 
what I've noticed, so that you people who don't have it can
drool even more).

Displacing Pets:  You're pet is in the way.  You move into him, 
  Zowie! He gets pushed out of the way and you move there.  No
  more need for smart pet mods.  (Although I wonder if this is
  true for REALLY big pets).

Reading Spellbooks:  You read them, and they don't disappear!
  You can read them again and again until you know the spell 
  REALLY well.  I'm not so sure about this change (bug or
  feature?).  Could lead to some serious abuse with polypiling.

Floating eyes: Your doggy hits one -- your doggy is frozen.

Throwing: You sometimes slip as you try to throw things -- the
  thing you were throwing lands behind you!

